			"start": 2367,
			"end": 2373
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " The pair the member position REQUIRES stays closed under the hoist: the run is",
			"start": 2380,
			"end": 2461
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " already emitted above, so the pair may not open around it a second time",
			"start": 2463,
			"end": 2537
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " (`Printer::required_paren_open_run`'s shell arm takes the same claim filter its edge",
			"start": 2539,
			"end": 2626
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " arm has). With no trailing run to lift, this is the shape where nothing else would",
			"start": 2628,
